<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Adelaide Brighton chairman retires.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Adelaide Brighton chairman retires.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cement manufacturer Adelaide Brighton Ltd said Rodney White will retire as a director and chairman of the board, effective December 31.</p>
<p>He will be replaced by Malcolm Kinnaird, the company said. Alan Powell will also retire as a director on December 31 after 36 years on the board.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
